# Maintainer whitelist.
#
# This file is the enforcing copy of the Maintainers table in AI_POLICY.md.
# GitHub requires a review from a listed owner before a pull request touching a
# matched path can merge, provided branch protection on `main` has "Require
# review from Code Owners" enabled. Without that setting this file is advisory
# only, exactly like the prose in AI_POLICY.md.
#
# Entries are GitHub usernames, not email addresses. GitHub does not resolve
# emails here. Contact addresses live in the AI_POLICY.md table.
#
# Adding or removing a maintainer is itself a maintainer-only change.

# Everything, so no path is left without an owner.
